WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
她：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
Her: (Doesn't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 1 轮 · Realtime round 1）

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:27.525
她：我是楼上的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
I'm the photographer upstairs. Your eyes?

00:00:27.725 --> 00:00:32.549
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:32.749 --> 00:00:35.061
摄影师。你是来拍我订婚的。
A photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:37.773 --> 00:00:40.085
Harland把订婚宣布提前了，还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:42.897 --> 00:00:45.197
她：什么叫我害的？你把话说清楚。
Her: What do you mean, I caused this? Explain yourself.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 2 轮 · Realtime round 2）

00:00:45.297 --> 00:00:50.121
她：她：什么叫我害的？
What do you mean, my doing?

00:00:50.321 --> 00:00:55.145
今晚起，我闻得到你。
Since tonight, I can smell you.

00:00:55.345 --> 00:00:57.155
Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:59.364 --> 00:01:01.174
Alpha，电梯在动了。
Alpha, the elevator is moving.

00:01:05.493 --> 00:01:07.793
她：Mate是什么意思？我凭什么跟你走？
Her: What does Mate mean? Why should I go with you?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 3 轮 · Realtime round 3）

00:01:07.893 --> 00:01:11.042
她：Mate是什么意思？
What does Mate mean?

00:01:11.242 --> 00:01:14.392
一头狼，一个人，只有你。
One wolf. One person. Only you.

00:01:22.965 --> 00:01:25.277
路上说清楚，然后你再决定。
Explain on the way. Then I'll decide.

00:01:28.089 --> 00:01:30.389
她：我把手覆上他的拳头。
Her: I lay my hand over his fist.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 4 轮 · Realtime round 4）

00:01:33.838 --> 00:01:36.988
她：你不会伤我的。
You won't hurt me.

00:01:37.188 --> 00:01:40.337
小心。我快撑不住了。
Careful. I'm barely holding on.

00:01:40.537 --> 00:01:43.686
Magnus，你在哪？
Magnus, where are you?

00:01:43.886 --> 00:01:47.036
别再打来了。
Don't call again.

00:01:50.685 --> 00:01:52.985
她：那震动声是什么？是不是有人追来了？
Her: What's that rumbling? Is someone coming after us?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 5 轮 · Realtime round 5）

00:01:53.085 --> 00:01:56.234
她：那震动是什么？有人追来了吗？
Was that someone chasing us?

00:01:56.434 --> 00:01:59.584
是Selene。她会跟来。
Selene. She'll follow.

00:02:03.133 --> 00:02:05.445
我们到了。
We're here.

00:02:10.669 --> 00:02:12.981
我不是人类。而你，改变了一切。
Not human. And you changed everything.

00:02:13.281 --> 00:02:15.581
她：未婚妻在找你。那你到底选她还是选我？
Her: Your fiancée is looking for you. So who do you choose, her or me?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 6 轮 · Realtime round 6）

00:02:19.030 --> 00:02:22.180
我选的是你。
I chose you.

00:02:25.729 --> 00:02:27.539
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就走了。
I walked out the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:29.748 --> 00:02:31.558
你在发抖。进来吧。
You're shaking. Come inside.

00:02:35.877 --> 00:02:38.177
她：我走近他，问订婚的事。
Her: I walk up to him and ask about the engagement.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 7 轮 · Realtime round 7）

00:02:38.277 --> 00:02:43.101
她：告诉我订婚的事。
Tell me about the engagement.

00:02:43.301 --> 00:02:48.125
结束了。Selene从来不是我的。
It's over. Selene was never mine.

00:02:48.325 --> 00:02:50.135
你还在发抖。
You're still shaking.

00:02:54.354 --> 00:02:56.163
Alpha，Arkwright小姐到了。
Alpha, Miss Arkwright is here.

00:02:58.473 --> 00:03:00.773
她：我冷。你的庄园有热的东西喝吗？给我倒杯酒。
Her: I'm cold. Does your manor have anything hot to drink? Pour me a glass of wine.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 8 轮 · Realtime round 8）

00:03:00.873 --> 00:03:05.697
她：我冷。给我倒杯酒。
I'm cold. Pour me a drink.

00:03:05.897 --> 00:03:10.721
等在这儿。
Wait here.

00:03:13.433 --> 00:03:15.745
喝吧，能暖和起来。
Drink. It'll warm you.

00:03:18.457 --> 00:03:20.769
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:03:21.069 --> 00:03:23.369
她：谁在敲门？是不是你的未婚妻追来了？
Her: Who's knocking? Did your fiancée follow you here?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 9 轮 · Realtime round 9）

00:03:23.469 --> 00:03:28.293
她：这是你的未婚妻吗？
Is that your fiancée outside?

00:03:28.493 --> 00:03:33.317
是Selene。待在我身后。
Selene. Stay behind me.

00:03:33.517 --> 00:03:35.327
Luca，让她进来。
Luca. Let her in.

00:03:35.527 --> 00:03:37.336
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:03:43.665 --> 00:03:45.965
她：我走到他面前，抚上他的脸
Her: I walk up to him and touch his face.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 10 轮 · Realtime round 10）

00:03:51.089 --> 00:03:55.913
别走。
Don't go.

00:03:58.625 --> 00:04:00.937
那是什么？
Then what is it?

00:04:01.137 --> 00:04:03.449
她：我不是在怕你。
I'm not afraid of you.

00:04:06.261 --> 00:04:08.561
她：好，我留下来。但你得陪我坐下，别再躲着我。
Her: Fine, I'll stay. But you have to sit with me and stop avoiding me.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 11 轮 · Realtime round 11）

00:04:08.661 --> 00:04:13.485
她：我留下。陪我坐下。
I'll stay. Sit with me.

00:04:13.685 --> 00:04:18.509
再说一遍。
Say it again.

00:04:22.058 --> 00:04:23.533
我不会再躲着你了。
I'm done hiding from you.

00:04:27.082 --> 00:04:28.557
今晚留下来陪我。
Stay with me tonight.

00:04:28.857 --> 00:04:31.157
她：狼嚎是怎么回事？你们的人会来吗？
Her: What's with the howling? Will your people come?
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 12 轮 · Realtime round 12）

00:04:31.257 --> 00:04:36.081
她：她问狼嚎是怎么回事，他们会不会来
Was that a howl? Will they come?

00:04:36.281 --> 00:04:41.105
他说是族人在回应他
My pack. They're answering me.

00:04:41.305 --> 00:04:43.617
Luca在门外说Harland已召集长老，今晚要她
Alpha. Harland called the elders. Tonight.

00:04:43.817 --> 00:04:46.129
他眼睛变金，说要当面给答复
Then they'll hear my answer.

00:04:51.453 --> 00:04:53.753
她：我走下石阶，迎向松林
Her: I walk down the stone steps toward the pine forest.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 13 轮 · Realtime round 13）

00:04:53.853 --> 00:04:58.677
她：我要出去。
I'm going out there.

00:04:58.877 --> 00:05:03.701
那我陪你走。
Then I walk with you.

00:05:12.274 --> 00:05:13.749
站近些，他们已经认得你了。
Stay close. They know you now.

00:05:14.049 --> 00:05:16.349
她：先别去长老会。这些眼睛是谁？我要看清楚。
Her: Don't go to the Elders yet. Whose eyes are these? I want to see clearly.
（实时生成 · 10+10 · 第 14 轮 · Realtime round 14）

00:05:16.449 --> 00:05:21.273
她：谁的眼睛？
Who are those eyes?

00:05:21.473 --> 00:05:26.297
看吧。我不拦你。
Look. I won't stop you.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.345
他们是我的族人。还不是敌人。
They are my pack. Not enemies yet.
